OL,5,G2300 The Suspect
OL,6,     FDr Joe O'Loughlin is a
OL,7,     Fpsychologist with a successful
OL,8,     Fprivate practice and a published
OL,9,     Fbook to his name, but a recent
OL,10,     Flife-changing medical diagnosis
OL,11,     Fhas thrown him off-balance.
OL,12,G0005 The Serpent
OL,13,     FInspired by a true story. Bangkok,
OL,14,     F1975. Charles Sobhraj is a thief
OL,15,     Fand a conman posing as a gem
OL,16,     Fdealer, luring young westerners to
OL,17,     Fhis apartment where he drugs and
OL,18,     Frobs them
